ublic personal information to a non-affiliated third party unless the consumer is given an explanation of how to exercise the nondisclosure option. I the consumer was never given an explanation on how to exercise the nondisclosure option and have violated my privacy and have failed to protect the confidentiality of my information. This has cause signifacte damage to my reputation and credit worthiness and has started to effect me emotionally and finically. Failure to Describe Opt-Out Policies ( 15 USC 6802 ( a ) ) Equifax, XXXX, and XXXX did not adequately describe their opt-out policies and procedures in their privacy notice. Law 15 USC 6803 ( a ) requires financial institutions to provide a clear, conspicuous, and accurate statement of their privacy practices, including information on consumers rights to opt out. I the consumer have never received any notice to Opt-Out and the policies to exercise my rights. 

